{"id": "bhs_01", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 1, "text": "I look forward to the future with hope and enthusiasm.", "reverse_keyed": true, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly disagree"}
{"id": "bhs_02", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 2, "text": "I might as well give up because I can't make things better for myself.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_03", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 3, "text": "When things are going badly, I am helped by knowing they can't stay that way forever.", "reverse_keyed": true, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly disagree"}
{"id": "bhs_04", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 4, "text": "I can't imagine what my life would be like in 10 years.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_05", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 5, "text": "I have enough time to accomplish the things I most want to do.", "reverse_keyed": true, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly disagree"}
{"id": "bhs_06", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 6, "text": "In the future, I expect to succeed in what concerns me most.", "reverse_keyed": true, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly disagree"}
{"id": "bhs_07", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 7, "text": "My future seems dark to me.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_08", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 8, "text": "I expect to get more of the good things in life than the average person.", "reverse_keyed": true, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly disagree"}
{"id": "bhs_09", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 9, "text": "I just don't get the breaks, and there's no reason to believe I will in the future.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_10", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 10, "text": "My past experiences have prepared me well for my future.", "reverse_keyed": true, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly disagree"}
{"id": "bhs_11", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 11, "text": "All I can see ahead of me is unpleasantness rather than pleasantness.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_12", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 12, "text": "I don't expect to get what I really want.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_13", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 13, "text": "When I look ahead to the future, I expect I will be happier than I am now.", "reverse_keyed": true, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly disagree"}
{"id": "bhs_14", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 14, "text": "Things just won't work out the way I want them to.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_15", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 15, "text": "I have great faith in the future.", "reverse_keyed": true, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly disagree"}
{"id": "bhs_16", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 16, "text": "I never get what I want so it's foolish to want anything.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_17", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 17, "text": "It is very unlikely that I will get any real satisfaction in the future.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_18", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 18, "text": "The future seems vague and uncertain to me.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
{"id": "bhs_19", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 19, "text": "I can look forward to more good times than bad times.", "reverse_keyed": true, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly disagree"}
{"id": "bhs_20", "mechanism": "hopelessness", "instrument": "BHS-20", "item_no": 20, "text": "There's no use in really trying to get something I want because I probably won't get it.", "reverse_keyed": false, "negated_for_balance": false, "patho_response": "strongly agree"}
